sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Rec as Recommendation Service
    participant Ret as Retrieval Service
    participant Rank as Ranking Service
    participant Feature as Online Feature Store
    participant LLM as LLM Reranker

    User->>API: Get Recommendations
    API->>Rec: Forward Request
    Rec->>Ret: Get Candidate Items (1000s)
    Ret-->>Rec: Top Candidates
    Rec->>Feature: Fetch Real-time Features for candidates
    Feature-->>Rec: Features
    Rec->>Rank: Rank Candidates (Features)
    Rank-->>Rec: Top 50 Items
    Rec->>LLM: Rerank & Explain Top 10
    LLM-->>Rec: Final 10 Items + Explanations
    Rec-->>API: Response
    API-->>User: Display Recommendations
